(WSL) Tj
T*
(Import full-i3 with scripts/install-wsl-distro.sh --distro Ooonana --tarball) Tj
T*
(/var/tmp/ooonana-os/release/ooonana-full-i3-wsl-rootfs.tar.gz --force) Tj
T*
(Launch with: wsl.exe -d Ooonana -- /usr/bin/start-ooonana-i3) Tj
T*
(WSL GUI needs WSLg or an X server with DISPLAY set.) Tj
T*
(Update an imported distro with: ooonana update && ooonana upgrade) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AI) Tj
T*
(Ooonana AI runs as ooonana ai ... or ooonana-ai. It supports cloud providers, offline) Tj
T*
(Intel OpenVINO, ask/chat, tools, tasks, audit, history, status, and a native GUI.) Tj
T*
(The full-i3 desktop includes a ChatGPT-style AI workspace, Settings, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth,) Tj
T*
(Packages, and Spotlight-style application launcher.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Desktop and hardware) Tj
T*
(The i3 desktop uses black/orange Ooonana styling, explicit close/minimize/fullscreen) Tj
T*
(controls, icon-first polybar, audio, brightness, power, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and) Tj
T*
(wallpaper modes. Default fit mode preserves aspect ratio with black side bars.) Tj
T*
(Wi-Fi supports personal and enterprise profiles. NetworkManager, BlueZ, D-Bus, Intel) Tj
T*
(Wi-Fi/Bluetooth firmware, Chromium, Python 3, sudo, su, and doas are included in) Tj
T*
(full-i3.) Tj
T*
